  "name": "CnC_Generals_Zero_Hour",
  "description": "This repository contains the source code for the SAGE (Strategy Action Game Engine) powering Command & Conquer: Generals and its expansion, Zero Hour. The architecture integrates the W3D (Westwood 3D) rendering pipeline with a sophisticated GameLogic subsystem handling AI state machines, pathfinding, and physics simulations. It features extensive support for legacy middleware including RAD Miles, Bink, and GameSpy, while providing full implementation of the game's GUI, networking, and asset management systems.",
